			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10151101,
					"content": "好了，如此一來，幫工也雇了，「永生香」也已備齊。離典儀的準備完成也不遠了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151102,
					"content": "呼…終於！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151103,
					"content": "如何？旅者。在這場向岩神辭行的旅途裡，有什麼收穫嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151104,
					"content": "真是一趟奇奇怪怪的旅途。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151105,
					"content": "奇奇怪怪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151106,
						10151107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151106,
					"content": "不知該說是體驗了富豪的生活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151108,
					"content": "哈哈哈，答案是哪一種呢？旅途中的疑問，總是如此複雜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151109,
					"content": "旅者的體驗就交給旅者自己慢慢咀嚼吧。對了，作為一起籌辦「送仙典儀」的報酬，我決定——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151110,
					"content": "請客。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151111,
						10151112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151111,
					"content": "鍾離…請客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151113,
					"content": "嗯？哦，放心。這一次，我會記得帶錢的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151114,
					"content": "#今天晚上，我會帶{F#妳}{M#你}去尋訪市井盛讚的港口老窖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151115,
					"content": "港口老窖？喝酒的那種嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151116,
					"content": "沒錯。我們在碼頭附近的「三碗不過港」，不見不散。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鍾離"
				},
				{
					"id": 10151112,
					"content": "天啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10151107,
					"content": "還是體驗了貧者的掙扎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10151108
					]
				}
			]
		},
